  "details": "The world End of Traditions, when set as your homeworld, somehow breaks the Cards Against Humanity world such that cards can't be picked up by you, and you can't see other players moving their cards around either. You also can't see other players change their station skin most of the time. The pen works fine though.\n\nThis isn't a bug report for End of Traditions or Cards Against Humanity however. The issue is that whatever EoT is doing is being carried over to another world, suggesting that something is not being reset or unloaded completely when VRChat switches worlds.\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_ab621a82-0d91-4409-bc3e-b91e13e22a68\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_36f7dcef-7753-47c6-93c8-009d101c5195",
